{"Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003826": "「イング、お前の力で我は屠れぬ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003857": "「真髄に達していないＳＲＸで我は倒せぬ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003894": "「不完全な機体で、我を倒せると思うな」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x0038CE": "「無駄だ……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x0038E7": "「その手は食わぬ……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x00390C": "「これで流れを変える……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003937": "「そう易々と……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003956": "「彼奴を勢い付かせるわけにはいかぬ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003990": "「弱者が群れをなしても、結果は見えている」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x0039D0": "「人を創りし者は神、神を創りし者は人……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003A10": "「手を止め、新人祖の誕生を祝福せよ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003A47": "「………」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003A57": "「彼奴らに/　時を与えるわけにはいかぬ…………！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003AA1": "「アダマトロンが反撃できぬとは……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003ADB": "「小賢しい真似を……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003B00": "「機を逃すとは……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003B22": "「アダマトロンの機能が低下している……！？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003B65": "「お前に逃げ場はない」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003B87": "「そう上手く事は運ばぬ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003BAC": "「逃がさぬ……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003BC8": "「どこへ逃れようとも……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003BF3": "「新人祖の産声を聞き届け、隠滅せよ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003C2A": "「新人祖の誕生を讃えつつ、消散せよ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003C61": "「新しき楽園の主として相応しい存在は、/　新人祖たる我……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003CBA": "「お前達はここより去れ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003CE2": "「我が永久の楽園に古き血脈はいらぬ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003D1F": "「冥底へ堕ちよ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003D3B": "「かつてのアダムは/　エデンの園より追放された……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003D88": "「お前達も同じ路を行け！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003DB0": "「輪廻転生しようとも、/　お前達の居場所はない……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003DFD": "「行け、因果地平の彼方へ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003E28": "「生まれよ、出でよ、我が下僕達……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003E5F": "「死者の霊魂……その呪いを享受せよ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003E96": "「冥底より……、来たれ、集まれ、亡者達……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003ED9": "「彼奴らの怨嗟……その身で受けよ！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003F10": "「イドオニー・ザアム・カーラー！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003F44": "「時間と空間が交差し、/　お前は古の忌憶を垣間見る」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003F91": "「これは黒き地獄」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003FAD": "「これは黒き天使」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003FC9": "「これは黒き銃神」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x003FE5": "「これは古き人祖達」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x004004": "「至高の知識が、/　お前の脳髄を焼滅させる……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/302.bmd|0x00404E": "「エルヨウン・イェダ・ドーマー！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/303.bmd|0x0003A4": "「………」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/303.bmd|0x0003B4": "「！？！？！？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/303.bmd|0x0003CD": "「………！！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/303.bmd|0x0003E6": "「………！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/303.bmd|0x0003FC": "「………？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/304.bmd|0x0003A4": "「………」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/304.bmd|0x0003B4": "「！？！？！？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/304.bmd|0x0003CD": "「………！！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/304.bmd|0x0003E6": "「………！！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/304.bmd|0x0003FC": "「………？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/305.bmd|0x0014C4": "所属不明兵", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/305.bmd|0x0014D4": "所属不明兵", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/305.bmd|0x0014E4": "所属不明兵", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/305.bmd|0x0014F4": "所属不明兵", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/305.bmd|0x001504": "所属不明兵", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/305.bmd|0x001514": "所属不明兵", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/305.bmd|0x001524": "所属不明兵", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/305.bmd|0x001534": "所属不明兵", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/305.bmd|0x001544": "所属不明兵", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/305.bmd|0x001554": "所属不明兵", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/3